SET ECHO OFF
* ============================================================
* MCC_OBSERVATION_CANARIES_V7.DTS
*
* Purpose:
*   Observation-only canaries for known current gaps, transitional
*   behaviors, and deliberately incomplete areas.
*
* Contract:
*   - These are NOT hard pass/fail regressions.
*   - Output is inspected for drift or improvement.
*   - Expected failures should remain explicit.
*
* Scope:
*   - date comparison anomalies
*   - transitional public index workflow observations
*   - metadata mismatch observations
*   - command-surface gaps / usage-only probes
*   - delete/index propagation deferred areas
* ============================================================

ECHO ===== V7 OBSERVATION CANARIES START =====
COLOR DEFAULT
VERSION
INIT
SET PATH

ECHO ===== DATE COMPARISON CANARIES (KNOWN CURRENT FAILURES) =====
ECHO [KNOWN-FAIL] CURRENT EXPECT .F.:
CALC ((DATE() + 2) > DATE())
ECHO [KNOWN-FAIL] CURRENT EXPECT .F.:
CALC ((DATE() - 2) < DATE())
ECHO [KNOWN-FAIL] CURRENT EXPECT .F.:
CALC (CTOD("2000-01-01") + 1 = CTOD("2000-01-02"))
ECHO [KNOWN-FAIL] CURRENT EXPECT .F.:
CALC (CTOD("2000-01-01") - 1 = CTOD("1999-12-31"))
ECHO [KNOWN-FAIL] CURRENT EXPECT .F.:
CALC (DATEDIFF(DOB, DATE()) = -(DATE() - DOB))

ECHO ===== SHOW / DISPLAY SURFACE OBSERVATIONS =====
SCHEMAS OPEN DBF
SELECT STUDENTS
SHOW TABLE
SHOW COLUMNS
SHOW INDEX
DBAREA
AREA
STATUS
WSREPORT

ECHO ===== COMMAND-SURFACE GAPS / OBSERVATIONS =====
DBAREAS
FIND Taylor
FIND White
SEEK Davis
SEEK Alex
PTALK DUMP

ECHO ===== TRANSITIONAL PUBLIC INDEX WORKFLOW (LEGACY TABLE VS X64 INDEX) =====
SELECT STUDENTS
SET INDEX TO STUDENTS.cdx
SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
AREA
SHOW INDEX
TOP
RECNO
LIST 5

SET ORDER TO TAG FNAME
AREA
SHOW INDEX
TOP
RECNO
LIST 5

SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
AREA
SHOW INDEX
TOP
RECNO

ECHO ===== TEACHERS METADATA MISMATCH OBSERVATION =====
SELECT TEACHERS
SET INDEX TO TEACHERS.cdx
SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
AREA
SHOW INDEX
TOP
LIST 3
INDEXSEEK "WILSON"

ECHO ===== LMDB OPEN / USE OBSERVATION (ONLY IF CURRENT CONTRACT EXPECTS FAILURE) =====
LMDB
LMDB OPEN indexes/STUDENTS.cdx.d
LMDB USE LNAME
LMDB INFO
LMDB SEEK WILSON
LMDB SCAN A D
LMDB CLOSE

LMDB OPEN indexes/STUDENTS.cdx.d
LMDB USE FNAME
LMDB INFO
LMDB SEEK AVA
LMDB SCAN M Z
LMDB CLOSE

ECHO ===== WHERE / SHOW FILTER OBSERVATION =====
SELECT STUDENTS
SET INDEX TO STUDENTS.cdx
SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
TOP
LOCATE lname = Taylor
WHERE GPA >= 3.5
SHOW TABLE
SHOW INDEX
COUNT
TOP
SMARTLIST 5 FOR GPA >= 3.5

ECHO ===== FILTER + ORDER OBSERVATIONS =====
SET FILTER TO LNAME = "TAYLOR"
COUNT
TOP
LIST 20
SET FILTER TO

SET FILTER TO LNAME = "ANDERSON"
COUNT
TOP
LIST 20
SET FILTER TO

SET FILTER TO FNAME = "AVA"
COUNT
TOP
LIST 20
SET FILTER TO

ECHO ===== BUFFER / INDEX DELETE GAP (DOCUMENTED DEFERRED AREA) =====
ECHO [DEFERRED] Index update coverage currently includes create/modify only.
ECHO [DEFERRED] Delete propagation is not yet implemented.
ECHO [DEFERRED] Algorithms in cmd_delete.cpp should be considered later.

SELECT STUDENTS
SET INDEX TO STUDENTS.cdx
SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
LOCATE lname = Taylor
TABLE ON
DELETE NEXT 1
COUNT DELETED
RECALL NEXT 1
COUNT DELETED
TABLE OFF

ECHO ===== SCRIPT ASSUMPTION DRIFT CHECK =====
ECHO [OBSERVE] Some DTS scripts still assume:
ECHO [OBSERVE]   - DBF and XDBF are interchangeable
ECHO [OBSERVE]   - index containers and LMDB envs are the same thing
ECHO [OBSERVE] Review any failures here before blaming engine code.

ECHO ===== CLEAN SHUTDOWN =====
SET ORDER TO 0
SCHEMAS
SCHEMAS CLOSE
ECHO ===== V7 OBSERVATION CANARIES END =====
QUIT